# Origin of the existing Laravel backend that handles the three site forms
# (POST /home/ajax/quote, /home/ajax/contact, /home/ajax/newsletter, /user/login).
# Leave empty during development: forms then report that they are not connected
# instead of sending real enquiries or pretending to succeed.
# Set to the backend origin (e.g. https://www.nebenkams.com) only when the pages are
# served by, or CORS/CSRF-enabled on, that backend.
PUBLIC_FORM_API_BASE=
